    narr: 'Now the path runs from (-1, 1) down through the origin and up to (2, 4). The tangent swings from down-right to steeply up-right while the field rotates with x, so F\u00B7T changes sign \u2014 the orange stretch near the start subtracts, the blue stretch adds.',
    st: { mode: 'b', t: 0, comp: true }
  },
  {
